# Escrow Payment & Order Creation Module Plan

This plan outlines the architecture for integrating a secure Escrow Payment system into the checkout flow. The system will simulate a MetaMask transaction that locks funds in a blockchain smart contract before the backend order is finalized.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **MetaMask Simulation:** Since we are not currently connecting to a real Web3 provider (like ethers.js or viem) injected by a browser extension in this sandbox environment, the MetaMask flow will be simulated using a high-fidelity modal that mimics the signing and transaction processing experience.
> **Order Creation Timing:** The order will now strictly be created *after* the simulated blockchain transaction confirms, passing the resulting `tx_hash` to the backend.

